---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PlatformSection from "../components/PlatformSection.astro";
import { platforms } from "../data/platforms";
import senamhiHero from "../../assets/senamhi-overview.png";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Plataformas climáticas | Física de la Atmósfera"
  description="Guía detallada para consultar SENAMHI Bolivia, Ventusky, NASA Earthdata, Copernicus y Earth NullSchool."
>
  <section class="directory-hero">
    <div class="shell directory-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Cinco formas de mirar la atmósfera</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Elegí la herramienta según tu pregunta.</h1>
        <p class="lead">No todas las plataformas muestran lo mismo. Conocé qué datos ofrece cada una, cómo comenzar y cuándo conviene utilizarla.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="directory-hero-visual" src={senamhiHero.src} width={senamhiHero.width} height={senamhiHero.height} alt="Vista del portal de SENAMHI Bolivia" />
      <nav class="platform-index" aria-label="Índice de plataformas">
        {platforms.map((platform, index) => (
          <a href={`#${platform.slug}`}>
            <span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
            {platform.name}
          </a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="platform-list">
    {platforms.map((platform, index) => (
      <>
        <PlatformSection platform={platform} index={index} />
        {index === 1 && (
          <section class="directory-cta">
            <div class="shell cta-card">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Del mapa a la explicación</p>
                <h2>¿Querés ver el recorrido paso a paso?</h2>
                <p>Las videoguías muestran cómo empezar con SENAMHI y Ventusky sin perderse entre capas y controles.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="button button-accent" href="/guias/">Ir a las videoguías <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </section>
        )}
      </>
    ))}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .directory-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--navy);
    padding-block: 92px;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .directory-hero::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: -180px;
    bottom: -310px;
    width: 650px;
    height: 650px;
    border: 100px solid rgba(6, 198, 175, 0.12);
    border-radius: 50%;
    content: "";
  }

  .directory-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(220px, 0.65fr) 0.48fr;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 70px;
  }

  .directory-hero .eyebrow,
  .directory-hero .page-title { color: var(--white); }
  .directory-hero .eyebrow::before { background: var(--yellow); }
  .directory-hero .lead { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72); }

  .directory-hero-visual {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 170px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .platform-index {
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .platform-index a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    padding: 10px 3px;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .platform-index a:hover { color: var(--yellow); }
  .platform-index span { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.7rem; }

  .directory-cta {
    padding-block: 82px;
    background: var(--blue-soft);
  }

  .cta-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: clamp(30px, 6vw, 58px);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .cta-card .eyebrow { color: var(--cyan); }
  .cta-card h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.05; }
  .cta-card p:last-child { max-width: 670px; margin-bottom: 0; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68); }
  .cta-card .button { flex: 0 0 auto; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .directory-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
    .directory-hero-visual { max-width: 430px; max-height: 210px; }
    .cta-card { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
